  "description": "Audio files a wavetable view takes, read as JUCE's AudioFormatManager (registerBasicFormats) reads them for WavetableEditSection::loadAudioFile: the first channel and the sample rate. The port's readers (port/crates/plugin/src/audio_file.rs) must match sample for sample (max_abs_error 0). The files are authored by generate.py (corpus/audio). Lossy formats aren't here: generate.py can't author them, and MP3/AAC are CoreAudio's on macOS (D23).",
